    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's complicated, but when you say it 'ultimately failed' in the long term, does that imply the whole thing was a mistake? like, looking at the chaos that followed, was there actually any strategic benefit to stepping in at all, or was it just a case of overreach?",
